Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:02:01.10,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\move(118,338,208,338)\fs14\shad0\c&H7F7B74&\3c&H9CA2D6&}Cream Bun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.50,0:02:03.99,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,They all look so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:11.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Can I have one cranberry and \Ncustard bun and a salt pizza, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:28.49,Default,Regular 5,0,0,0,,Oh! Hello, Kinme-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.87,0:02:33.01,Default,Regular 5,0,0,0,,I've got some clothes to give you. \NIs now all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.30,0:02:34.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh... Mm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:38.51,Default,Regular 5,0,0,0,,Sorry to catch you on your lunch break!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.71,0:02:41.45,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.99,0:02:44.88,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Caught me off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.19,0:02:49.52,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnArial\fad(692,1)\shad0\c&H5ABBC6&\3c&H5D5D65&}Kinme Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:51.78,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\c&H46464C&\fnArial\fs18\frz337.7\move(326,171,311,171,24,2234)}Orders will be ready
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:51.78,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\frz335.6\bord0\shad0\c&H46464C&\fnArial\fs18\move(369,269,354,269,24,2234)}on the {\c&H3030A0&\b1\fs26}23rd
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.37,0:02:55.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hello, this is Kinme Cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.98,0:02:58.28,Italics,Ishimochi (Phone),0,0,0,,Hello? This is Ishimochi calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:03:01.61,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, Ishimochi-san? Nice to hear from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.61,0:03:06.79,Italics,Ishimochi (Phone),0,0,0,,So it seems you let my Kyu borrow \Nan umbrella the other day. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:11.66,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, not at all. I'm sorry \NI only had one with the shop logo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:13.55,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,I should have him thank you himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.55,0:03:16.84,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Hey, Kyu! Get your butt down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:19.43,Italics,Kinme,0,0,0,,No, really, it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.95,0:03:21.51,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.51,0:03:23.78,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Anyway, will they be ready tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.78,0:03:26.19,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,I'll bring your umbrella \Nwhen I go pick them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.19,0:03:32.13,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh. Actually, I realize it's a bit early, \Nbut your items are ready now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.55,0:03:36.17,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Why don't I bring them to you later today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.17,0:03:38.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I can pick up the umbrella\N while I'm at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:42.33,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Oh, would you really?\N Sorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:46.58,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No trouble at all. I have to make \Nmy evening delivery run anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.90,0:03:49.12,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll see you then, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:14.48,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H4E7F37&\3c&HB3D8AA&\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman}We Pick Up and Deliver!\N{\c&H2A433D&\3c&HDEF1DD&\fnArial\b1}Kinme Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.24,0:04:24.49,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs24\an8\fnArial\c&H6367BD&\3c&H9EA8E7&\b1}Guesthouse Inn Ishimochi
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.81,0:04:26.97,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Phew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.67,0:04:32.50,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Good evening! It's Kinme Cleaning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.87,0:04:42.14,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.50,0:04:45.20,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Kinme-san, thanks for\N going out of your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:47.23,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Could you just leave them by the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.23,0:04:48.77,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,And your umbrella's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.77,0:04:50.37,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:54.65,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Here's that Doburoku I was talking about. \NYou're gonna love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.65,0:04:56.16,Default,Customer 1,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.85,0:05:03.01,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,You need some more rice, boys? \NHow about more miso soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.01,0:05:04.66,Default,Customer 2,0,0,0,,Sure, I could use seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.66,0:05:06.02,Default,Customer 3,0,0,0,,Just miso soup for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.02,0:05:06.97,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Comin' up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.29,0:05:09.78,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Oh! He still hasn't thanked her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:12.46,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Kyu! Get your butt down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:14.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Ah, that's really all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:19.60,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I need to get going anyway. \NI'm sorry for bothering you during dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:23.62,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Kinme-san, I bet you're drenched in sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.62,0:05:26.93,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,While you're here, why not take \Na dip in our hot spring?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.55,0:05:31.44,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.44,0:05:34.48,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm not a paying customer...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.48,0:05:35.81,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Aw, it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.19,0:05:41.32,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,We're just a small inn, but we're sure \Nproud of our natural hot spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.66,0:05:55.08,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I have so much trouble\N resisting temptation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:59.23,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,But I guess I am done\N with work for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.59,0:06:02.35,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Might as well enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.33,0:06:05.14,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Kinme-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:06.78,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Ah! Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.10,0:06:10.90,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,When you get out, \Nyou can go cool off on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.90,0:06:13.01,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.41,0:06:16.98,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Caught off guard again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.75,0:06:43.63,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,So are you Kyu, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.89,0:06:47.04,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Actually, my name is Kyusho.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:48.51,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:53.63,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I bet you get a lot of reservations \Nfor days with fireworks shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.63,0:06:55.77,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You've basically got front-row seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.77,0:06:58.77,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yes. We get booked up far in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:03.90,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\b1\fs17\c&HACE3FF&\3c&H3C7CF0&\blur2\move(324,38,324,24}Atami\N{\fs20}Seaside Fireworks Show\N{\fs8\3c&H364FCC&}A Symphony of Fireworks Painting the Sky with Seasonal Colors
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:03.90,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\b1\fs10\c&HACCFFF&\3c&H586BC9&\blur2\move(253,243,253,225,0,5111)}Spring
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:03.90,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\b1\fs10\c&HACCFFF&\3c&H766D83&\blur2\move(300,243,300,225,0,5111)}Summer
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:03.90,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\b1\fs10\c&HACCFFF&\3c&H1E5FA8&\blur2\move(347,243,347,225,0,5111)}Fall
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:03.90,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\b1\fs10\c&HACCFFF&\3c&H47379F&\blur2\move(396,243,396,225,0,5111)}Winter
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:03.90,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\b1\fs8\c&H576E9E&\3c&HB1CEF4&\move(325,315,325,299,0,5111)\bord3\b1}Please help us keep your trip to Atami safe and comfortable.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.16,0:07:03.90,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Some regulars already have reservations \Nfor every event from now to February.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.90,0:07:05.50,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Wow, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:08.38,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,February? That's got to be\N more than ten shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:09.21,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.21,0:07:11.66,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Are those guests\N staying tonight also regulars?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:15.97,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Well, those men are here\N for a construction job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.97,0:07:17.96,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,They've been staying for about two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.96,0:07:19.17,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Two weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:24.17,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs24\an8\fnArial\c&HD8D9DC&\3c&HA695BA&}Guesthouse Inn Ishimochi
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.49,0:07:24.17,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,We're a small inn, but we're inexpensive, \Nso we get all sorts of guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:27.07,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Sometimes we even get foreign backpackers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.07,0:07:29.68,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh. No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.68,0:07:32.48,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,But our bath is pretty great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:37.44,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,We're just a small inn, but we're \Nreal proud of our natural hot spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.50,0:07:43.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Your mother seems like\N a very generous hostess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:47.04,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,More like annoying when \Nyou're stuck in a family with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:49.95,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,That still sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.95,0:07:52.65,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I wish I had family members \Nthat were annoyingly close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.33,0:07:54.45,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:08:00.21,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I can't even remember \Nif I had any family at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:04.46,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,My memory only goes back two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.46,0:08:07.22,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It seems I washed \Nall my older memories clean away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.97,0:08:15.24,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh! But I'm okay! \NI don't really worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.24,0:08:17.73,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh? O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.01,0:08:22.19,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,A-Anyway, I don't want to overstay \Nmy welcome, so I should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:27.74,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,I hope you still remember\N what I asked before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:31.33,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Your schoolbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:31.33,Default - Top,Kyusho,0,0,0,,My schoolbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.59,0:08:42.08,Flashback,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Do you think you could clean \Nmy schoolbag for me sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.51,0:08:45.56,Flashback,Kinme,0,0,0,,Sure! You can count on Kinme.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.55,0:08:51.68,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs24\an8\fnArial\c&H958B75&\3c&HECECEC&\b1}Guesthouse Inn Ishimochi
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.64,0:08:56.02,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,I mean, her memory seems fine to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.02,0:08:59.38,Default,Ishimochi,0,0,0,,Kyu! Don't forget to scrub \Nthe bath when you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:04.98,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(419,24)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:09.99,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(90,254)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.68,0:09:23.25,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,It's been pretty quiet all day. It seems \Nlike things are settling down again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.04,0:09:27.52,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I guess we're almost over the hump of \Npeople sorting through winter clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.31,0:09:31.13,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I should think about making a new \Nbatch of flyers to pass around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.12,0:09:40.02,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Nairo, it is all right if you want to \Ngo on ahead to meet Grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.31,0:09:44.43,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,No, I'll go with you \Nlike it's a school field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.86,0:09:48.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:52.53,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.80,0:09:54.08,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Good afternoon to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.05,0:09:56.88,Italics,Kinme (N),0,0,0,,Wow, she's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.81,0:10:00.16,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.16,0:10:01.85,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Good afternoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.85,0:10:03.57,Italics,Kinme (N),0,0,0,,She's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.52,0:10:06.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Is this your first time visiting us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:10.92,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Yes. My friend told me about your shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.92,0:10:14.26,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,I hear that you are very skilled\N at removing stains,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.26,0:10:16.05,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,so I thought I'd ask for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.33,0:10:19.18,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much! I'm flattered!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.31,0:10:24.42,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Our motto here is \N"Local Cleaning with a Heart."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.42,0:10:27.13,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,In addition to clothing, \Nwe clean shoes, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.13,0:10:30.11,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,but also other kinds of \Naccessories, leather or fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.67,0:10:33.39,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Also, while we do have a limited range,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.39,0:10:36.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,with just a call, we'll go straight to \Nyour home for pick-up and delivery—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:39.71,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,a service particularly appreciated by \Nelderly members of the community.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.31,0:10:44.56,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,At any rate, please allow me \Nto inspect your garments.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.03,0:10:46.46,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.99,0:10:51.59,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh. It appears to have \Nsomething splattered on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:56.23,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,That's squid ink pasta sauce\N from dinner last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:11:00.10,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,There also appears\N to be something drawn on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:01.65,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,A meat bun?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.65,0:11:04.48,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I know! I can explain it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.48,0:11:08.12,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,That's my favorite place in the world! \NSaint Basil's Cathedral!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.48,0:11:16.22,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,You see, my daughter simply loves to draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:20.23,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,She seems to have been inspired when \Nthe squid ink splattered on the blouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.23,0:11:23.68,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,so she stuck her finger \Nin the sauce and then drew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.19,0:11:25.63,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,It is all so embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.15,0:11:27.40,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I am very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.30,0:11:30.18,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, it happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.18,0:11:32.00,Italics,Kinme (N),0,0,0,,Maybe she's not so cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:35.27,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Um, do you think\N you'll be able to clean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.48,0:11:41.51,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You can count on Kinme.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.54,0:11:56.99,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Hey, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.45,0:12:00.98,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I want to learn how to \Nget stains out of clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.98,0:12:04.24,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,Oh? But what about visiting Grandmother?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:06.50,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I will go by myself later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.83,0:12:12.50,Default,Nairo's Mom,0,0,0,,In that case, go and ask the nice lady \Nif it's all right to observe her at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:13.65,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.14,0:12:16.93,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Onee-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.38,0:12:20.39,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Would you please let me\N observe you working?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.77,0:12:24.48,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.64,0:12:25.39,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(75,198)\b1\shad0\fad(1228,1)\c&H60543C&\3c&HFAF6F6&\fs26}Okay, yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.64,0:12:25.39,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\shad0\fad(1228,1)\c&H60543C&\3c&HFAF6F6&\fs26\pos(516,173)}she is cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.65,0:12:33.90,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:36.60,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,What is that stuff you are painting on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.02,0:12:37.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.28,0:12:41.99,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,This is a stain treatment \Ndesigned to break down oils.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.28,0:12:54.29,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(398,1)\fnArial\shad0\an8\fs20\pos(321,26)\c&HE6EEDB&\3c&H41551F&}The Structure of a Stain
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:54.29,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(398,1)\fnArial\shad0\an8\fs13\c&HE6EEDB&\3c&H41551F&\frz11.76\pos(194,96)}Oil-Based Stain
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:54.29,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(398,1)\fnArial\shad0\an8\fs11\c&HE6EEDB&\3c&H41551F&\frz15.44\pos(175,134)}Water-Based Stain
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:54.29,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(398,1)\fnArial\shad0\an7\fs10\c&HE6EEDB&\3c&H41551F&\pos(421,66)}* The composition of\N\h\h\h\h\heach stain is different,\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\hbut this is essentially\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hhow stains attach to fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.82,0:12:54.29,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(858,1)\fnArial\shad0\an8\fs14\c&HE6EEDB&\3c&H41551F&\frz15.44\pos(192,272)}Fabric
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.91,0:12:54.29,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(858,1)\fnArial\shad0\an8\fs17\c&HE6EEDB&\3c&H41551F&\frz356.7\pos(251,232)}Protein Stain
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.82,0:12:54.29,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(858,1)\fnArial\shad0\an8\fs17\c&HE6EEDB&\3c&H41551F&\pos(333,268)\frz0.001892}Dye
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.91,0:12:49.51,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(858,1)\fnArial\shad0\an8\fs17\c&HE6EEDB&\3c&H41551F&\frz6.024\pos(400,231)}Tannin Stain
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.09,0:12:47.23,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,There is a standard procedure \Nto follow when removing stains.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.23,0:12:49.65,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,First, you break down \Nthe oily part of the stain,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.65,0:12:53.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,and then you use different solvents to \Nwash out the other parts one by one.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.04,0:12:52.32,Default - Top,Nairo,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.29,0:12:58.67,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\fnArial\c&H6D6363&\3c&HF5F3F3&\fs22}Field Trip\N{\u1}Cleaners{\u0}\N\N{\fs17}A lady named\NKinme-san manages\Nthe shop by herself.\NRemove oil from\Na stain first.\NLots of detergents.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.29,0:12:58.67,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Hmm. So you use more than \Njust one detergent, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:03.30,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,How did you learn so much \Nabout detergents and stain removal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.05,0:13:06.68,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm. Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.98,0:13:10.69,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,How did I learn all of this? \NI guess it's a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.02,0:13:11.86,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.69,0:13:15.94,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\fnArial\c&H6D6363&\3c&HF5F3F3&\fs22}Field Trip\N{\u1}Cleaners{\u0}\N\N{\fs17}A lady named\NKinme-san manages\Nthe shop by herself.\NRemove oil from\Na stain first.\NLots of detergents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.69,0:13:15.94,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\fnArial\c&H6D6363&\3c&HF5F3F3&\fs17\pos(11,183)\clip(m 42 180 l 141 179 141 206 105 223 51 223 20 223 5 221 4 201 21 200 44 200)}How she learned it\Nis a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:16.77,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.95,0:13:23.58,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.05,0:13:23.87,Default - Top,Kinme,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:25.08,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.08,0:13:29.04,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, this shoots out steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:32.48,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,If you steam the spot where \Nyou applied the stain remover,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.48,0:13:34.75,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,it helps to release the stain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:39.07,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,And while you're doing that, the stand \Nhere sucks the stain out from below.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.07,0:13:41.59,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,It really works! It sucked it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.59,0:13:43.03,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.63,0:13:47.85,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,See? The stain is almost gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.85,0:13:51.60,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Wow! Amazing! It's like magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.89,0:13:56.36,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,This stain is still only a day old, \Nso it isn't that stubborn yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.62,0:14:00.72,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,So after this, we'll soak it in bleach \Nfor a while and it should be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.37,0:14:03.58,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I want to try removing stains too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.58,0:14:04.29,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:10.02,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No, no! I know this looks easy, \Nbut it's actually very delicate work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.02,0:14:12.62,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,This is something\N only professionals should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.62,0:14:17.13,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,But I would love to spray the steam! \NPretty please, Kinme-oneesama?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.13,0:14:22.38,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I promise to be a very good girl! \NI will do anything you say!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.55,0:14:27.89,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.18,0:14:31.42,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But we can't have you \Nhandling customers' garments,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.42,0:14:33.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,so you can work on one of my old towels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.73,0:14:36.04,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Nairo-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:37.84,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,One moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.76,0:14:41.75,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.75,0:14:43.40,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.40,0:14:46.16,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I drew a stain on my shirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.41,0:14:52.04,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,She might not be cute after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:59.17,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.17,0:15:03.12,Default - Top,Nairo,0,0,0,,It's so clean, it's so clean. \NThe towel has got so clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.12,0:15:05.93,Default - Top,Nairo,0,0,0,,It's so clean. And I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.75,0:15:05.49,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I'll have to wash this later by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.63,0:15:13.68,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Thank you for lending me this shirt \Nand for everything else today!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.98,0:15:19.86,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You're welcome. Just return that when \Nyou come to pick up your laundry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:20.59,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.47,0:15:26.82,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Next time I come, please let me assist you\Nwith cleaning customers' clothes too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:29.28,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:36.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I appreciate the offer, but I don't think \Nyou're ready for that yet, Nairo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.26,0:15:37.08,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:41.46,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,If you want to do a good job of \Ntaking care of other people's clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:46.12,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,you have to learn how to take \Ngood care of your own clothes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.47,0:15:50.54,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I believe that when clothes \Nare taken good care of,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:53.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,they fill up with their owner's\N life stories and memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.34,0:15:55.75,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,They turn into treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:15:59.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I don't have any memories \Nof my own past at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:07.24,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,That's why I want to help people take care\N of their treasures as long as they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.62,0:16:09.74,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.60,0:16:15.75,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Any time you want to learn more about \Ncleaning, come back and visit me. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:18.80,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.68,0:16:22.88,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Nairo-chan, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.39,0:16:27.15,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,She does seem to be a nice, \Npolite girl at heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.46,0:16:31.99,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, then. Shall we get washing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.76,0:16:41.40,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Is this the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:44.77,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Smells delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.15,0:16:47.40,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs16\b1\shad0\c&H695D4A&\3c&HC8C3B5&}Atsuei Dried Fish Company Direct Sales\NAtsuei Gift and Souvenir Shop
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.25,0:16:51.54,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.41,0:16:57.94,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Well, hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:17:02.17,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,I have dried horse mackerel \Nhot from the grill for just 250 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.17,0:17:06.43,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh! I actually received a call \Nthis morning for a laundry pick-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.43,0:17:08.19,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm from Kinme Cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.04,0:17:12.55,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Is this Katakuchi-san's residence?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.55,0:17:16.06,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Yes, that would be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.06,0:17:19.56,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,But what phone call? And a pick-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.56,0:17:20.95,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.95,0:17:23.76,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Oh! You really came, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.65,0:17:26.07,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Nairo-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.67,0:17:30.87,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,See, Grandmother? This is Kinme-oneesan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.87,0:17:35.06,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Oh my! Thank you for \Nwatching over Nairo the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:38.58,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Not at all. So is this store...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.89,0:17:42.08,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Yes! This is my grandmother's gift shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:46.59,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,There's no school today, \Nso I came here to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.59,0:17:49.67,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh? How sweet of you, Nairo-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.67,0:17:50.76,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Tee-hee.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:55.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um... Does that mean \Nthe phone call this morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.34,0:17:56.10,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:59.88,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I imitated Grandmother's voice \Nand called you myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.88,0:18:03.85,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask you to clean \Nsome things from her shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.85,0:18:06.85,Italics,Kinme,0,0,0,,I knew something was off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:11.11,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,This is what I'd like you to clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.99,0:18:17.49,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\fnTimesNewRoman\b1\shad0\c&HC4D8DF&}Celebrating a {\c&H3B56AF&\3c&HC7CFDA&}Big Catch\N{\fs30\c&H0A2133&}Atsueimaru\N{\fs18\c&H3B56AF&}Katakuchi Uretaro
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.07,0:18:16.41,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.74,0:18:22.50,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,My grandfather was a fisherman. He flew\N this banner when he got a big catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:28.50,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs20\b1\shad0\c&H695D4A&\3c&HD6DFDE&}Atsuei Dried Fish Company Direct Sales
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.50,0:18:26.33,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,They used to keep it hanging \Nat the entrance to the shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.33,0:18:30.37,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,but it started to get too dirty, \Nso they eventually brought it inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:32.10,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,That's what Grandmother told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.95,0:18:39.09,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Grandmother tried to send it out \Nfor washing several years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.09,0:18:40.77,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,but the cleaners refused to wash it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.46,0:18:42.94,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I can see why.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.94,0:18:46.77,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's a one-of-a-kind banner\Nthat a fisherman used for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.20,0:18:51.94,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,If you wash it too harshly, you're likely \Nto damage or tear the aging fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.51,0:18:55.53,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Do you think you can wash it for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.03,0:19:00.02,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,"You can count on Kinme"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.02,0:19:04.76,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,is what I would usually say, but please \Nallow me to borrow it for a while first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:10.04,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'd like to take a closer look before \NI decide if it will be possible to clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:12.20,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Is that all right with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.20,0:19:15.56,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Yes, all right.\N I will let my grandmother know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.27,0:19:18.04,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Oh, there's also...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.80,0:19:20.43,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,an apron and a bandana...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.56,0:19:22.31,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,and this curtain and that lap blanket...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:24.86,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,and some seat cushions \NI would like you to wash!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.86,0:19:25.81,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:28.11,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,There might be more, so I'll go ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.11,0:19:29.65,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.65,0:19:31.27,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Grandmother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.19,0:19:34.57,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Will it all fit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.57,0:19:36.57,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs26\b1\shad0\c&H262628&\3c&HC8C3B5&}Atsuei Gift and Souvenir Shop
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.57,0:19:45.08,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs13\b1\shad0\c&H695D4A&\3c&HB5A37D&\frz3.12\pos(51,172)}Atsuei Dried Fish Company Direct Sales
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.57,0:19:45.08,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs13\b1\shad0\c&H695D4A&\3c&HB5A37D&\frz3.12\pos(289,159)}Atsuei Gift and Souvenir Shop
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.57,0:19:45.08,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&HC0BEAE&\3c&H9A501C&\shad0\frz352.4\fs20\pos(486.5,67)}Gift Shop
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.57,0:19:45.08,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&HC0BEAE&\3c&H9A501C&\fs13\shad0\frz351.9\pos(507,85)}Atsuei Dried Fish Shop
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:40.00,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Grandmother, should we \Nsend that to get cleaned too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:42.54,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Hmm... I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:43.79,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.08,0:19:49.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um, are you sure it's okay to take your \Nnoren curtain down during business hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:54.85,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Oh, it's fine.\N Anything to keep Nairo happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.85,0:19:56.67,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Here you go, honey. Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.67,0:19:58.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What? U-Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.84,0:20:01.27,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But I'm still on the clock right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.10,0:20:08.60,Italics,Kinme,0,0,0,,Mmm! So fatty and delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:11.11,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Here, please wash this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.11,0:20:15.54,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm? Uh, okay. One second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.54,0:20:18.61,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,There's no rush. Please take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:24.37,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much. That was delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:28.97,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Even though I'm still working, \NI just couldn't resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.78,0:20:32.50,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Thank you. Please take care of our things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:34.63,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Thank you, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.63,0:20:39.38,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,My pleasure. I'll contact you \Nsometime tomorrow about the banner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.89,0:20:41.73,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll be on my way, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.73,0:20:43.56,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.56,0:20:44.75,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.89,0:20:50.40,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs10\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\pos(214,202)\c&H49656C&\3c&H7CB0BD&}Men's Bath
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.89,0:20:50.40,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\c&H49656C&\3c&H7CB8C7&\pos(413.286,202)}Women's Bath\h\h\h\hWomen's Bath
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.27,0:20:54.77,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to get\N such a big order today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.18,0:21:01.41,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Do you come here often?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.41,0:21:06.67,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Recently, it's only when \NNairo comes to spend the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.67,0:21:08.16,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.16,0:21:12.53,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,I used to come more often when \Nmy husband was still alive, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.53,0:21:16.65,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,But you know, that silly man, \Nhe actually hated the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.65,0:21:21.68,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Whenever he came with me, I couldn't \Nrelax and enjoy myself like I do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:25.53,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Huh? Did Grandfather \Nreally hate the bath that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.53,0:21:29.74,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Yes. During wintertime, \Nhe'd wait outside and yell to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.74,0:21:32.69,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,"Hurry up and get out! It's too cold!"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.09,0:21:35.61,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I absolutely love the bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.61,0:21:39.44,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,That's right, Nairo. \NYou just love baths, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.44,0:21:43.43,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,This one is even more fun \Nthan the bath at home!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.43,0:21:46.71,Default,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Is that right? Lucky you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.60,0:21:51.21,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Have a good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.60,0:21:51.21,Default - Top,Nairo's Grandma,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.21,0:21:52.46,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.04,0:21:58.46,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs20\b1\shad0\c&H6A8490&\3c&HCFE0DE&\fad(66,1)\frz13.75\move(230,4,206,-3)}Atsuei Dried Fish Company Direct Sales
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.75,0:22:02.61,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Nairo's grandmother \Nmust really treasure that banner.
